723 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 446 0 R
/T (The model averages about 32% accuracy across classes. Diagonal values are weak almost everywhere \(palm 0.21, fist 0.32, thumb 0.03\). The model uses "ok" as a dumping ground  c gets predicted as ok \(0.44\), index gets predicted as ok \(0.34\). The strongest classes are ok itself \(0.76\) and palm_moved \(0.58\), suggesting the linear decision boundary can only separate a few visually distinct gestures.)
/E (The model averages about 32% accuracy across classes. Diagonal values are weak almost everywhere \(palm 0.21, fist 0.32, thumb 0.03\). The model uses "ok" as a dumping ground  c gets predicted as ok \(0.44\), index gets predicted as ok \(0.34\). The strongest classes are ok itself \(0.76\) and palm_moved \(0.58\), suggesting the linear decision boundary can only separate a few visually distinct gestures.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
