<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 448 0 R
/T (Big jump to ~73% average diagonal. Same architecture as linear, but cross-entropy loss transforms the result. Strong classes: down \(0.99\), palm_moved \(0.95\), thumb \(0.91\), palm \(0.84\). Weak spot: fist at 0.37 confused with L \(0.18\), thumb \(0.20\), fist_moved \(0.07\). The visually-similar pairs we predicted are exactly the ones struggling.)
