<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (Mixed picture, average ~55%. Wins: palm_moved \(1.00 perfect\), palm \(0.89\), ok \(0.78\), c \(0.75\), thumb \(0.69\). Losses: down collapsed to 0.01 \(almost all predictions go to ok\), fist \(0.14 confused with fist_moved 0.50\), index \(0.37 confused with l 0.25 and c 0.32\). The model learned spatial structure \(palm/palm_moved perfect\) but only 5K parameters can't capture every gesture's nuances.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
