<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 456 0 R
/E (Train loss drops from 1.06 to near zero by epoch 5 and stays there. Train accuracy hits 100% around epoch 7 and never wavers. The model finds a near-perfect solution fast. While train is already memorizing the training set, val accuracy bounces because the model hasn't yet found weights that generalize even within the same people. The cosine learning-rate decay is what finally lets it settle.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
