<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 460 0 R
/E (On the subject split, our CNN drops from 100% to 87% and the confusion matrix shows exactly where. Six gestures still nail it: ok, c, down, index, palm, and l. These have distinctive silhouettes that generalize across hands. The surprise is thumb at 57%, with a third of thumb gestures predicted as down. They both look like a single vertical digit. The model can't fake this anymore  it has to actually distinguish similar shapes across people it has never seen.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
>>
